Predeclare accessible feasible goal with actual defer choice and later work/consequence;
positive independent raw reasons; no-bias/present-focused/no-immediate comparators;
unknown/unavailable/wrong/corrected future reports; missing access versus inability;
progress/fulfillment/cancellation/deadline separation; hidden/denied whole views;
all-stage rollback, ingress/authority negatives and all-prefix replay. This qualifies
bounded postponement under retained desire, not irrationality, moral failure, clinical
procrastination, universal impatience or all short/long-term goal conflicts.
